  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Match List I with List II</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">List I<br />\t\t\t(Example)</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">List II<br />\t\t\t(Type)</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">A</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>-chloro-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn></math>-butadiene</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">I</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Biodegradable polymer</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">B</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Nylon <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>-nylon <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">II</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Synthetic Rubber</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">C</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Polyacrylonitrile</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">III</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Polyester</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">D</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Dacron</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">IV</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Addition Polymer</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>"
  },
